?><!doctype html><html lang="so"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Googa – sug oggolaansho</title><style>body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#f4f1e9;color:#103654;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif}.card{max-width:420px;margin:20px;padding:30px;border-radius:28px;background:#fffdf7;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 18px 45px #10365422}p{line-height:1.6;color:#5b7185}</style><main class="card"><h1>Sug oggolaanshaha waalidka</h1><p>Codsi ayaa loo diray qalabka waalidka. Marka la oggolaado, Googa si toos ah ayuu u furmayaa.</p><p id="state">Waa la sugayaa …</p></main><script>let busy=false;async function poll(){if(busy)return;busy=true;try{const r=await fetch('family-pending-status.php',{cache:'no-store',credentials:'same-origin'}),d=await r.json();if(d.state==='approved'){location.replace('./');return}if(d.state==='denied'){document.querySelector('#state').textContent='Codsiga waa la diiday ama wuu dhacay.';return}}catch(e){}finally{busy=false}}poll();setInterval(poll,1500);</script></html>
